sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant Auth as AuthRouter
    participant API as AdminRouter
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Note over Admin,Auth: Admin Login
    Admin->>UI: Enter admin credentials
    UI->>Auth: POST /login
    Auth->>DB: Verify credentials and role is admin
    DB-->>Auth: Confirmed admin user
    Auth-->>UI: JWT in HTTP-only cookie
    UI-->>Admin: Redirect to Admin Dashboard

    Note over Admin,DB: Single Student Enrollment
    Admin->>UI: Select institution class and section
    Admin->>UI: Enter student ID in Single Enrol tab
    UI->>API: POST /admin/sections/{id}/enroll with student_id
    API->>DB: Check if student_id exists and not already enrolled
    DB-->>API: Student found and eligible
    API->>DB: INSERT into enrollments
    API->>DB: INSERT into enrollment_audit with action enrolled
    DB-->>API: Success
    API-->>UI: 201 Created
    UI-->>Admin: Student appears in enrolled list

    Note over Admin,DB: Bulk CSV Enrollment
    Admin->>UI: Upload CSV file with student IDs
    UI->>API: POST /admin/sections/{id}/csv-enroll with CSV file
    API->>API: Parse CSV rows into student ID list
    loop For each student ID
        API->>DB: Enroll student and write audit entry
    end
    API-->>UI: Summary of enrolled and failed IDs
    UI-->>Admin: Show enrollment results with count

    Note over Admin,DB: View Enrollment Audit Trail
    Admin->>UI: Click History tab on Enrollment Center
    UI->>API: GET /admin/sections/{id}/enrollment-history
    API->>DB: SELECT from enrollment_audit JOIN users
    DB-->>API: Log entries with timestamps and performed_by
    API-->>UI: Audit history array
    UI-->>Admin: Display audit table with all actions
